 ኤንታ ስእስ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"እ ሻራ ቱሳ ግዶራ ኤንታዉ ሃሳይስ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እ እምዳ ህግያነ ዎጋ ናግዶሶና።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"አቤት ጎዳዉ፥ ኑ ፆሳዉ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ነ ኤንታ ዎሳ ስአዳሳ።","poem":2},{"text":"ነ ኤንታና ማራዳሳ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ግዶሽን፥ ኤንታ ናጋራ ግሾ ኤንታ ሴራዳሳ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ጎዳይ ኑ ፆሳይ፥ ጌሽ ግድያ ግሾ፥","poem":1},{"text":"እያ ቁ ቁ ኦተ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"እያ ጌሻ ዙማ ቦላ እያ ጎይንተ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/99.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/100.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/98.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}